WEBVTT

00:10.890 --> 00:14.610
Today's the start of our third term, huh?

00:17.720 --> 00:19.710
It's freezing!

00:20.000 --> 00:22.240
And making us wear skirts even in winter?!

00:22.240 --> 00:25.620
How do they expect me 
to stay warm in this?!

00:27.570 --> 00:29.620
Oh, Mahiro-chan!

00:31.160 --> 00:32.680
Morning!

00:33.210 --> 00:34.920
Good morning!

00:34.920 --> 00:36.580
Good morning!

00:36.580 --> 00:38.630
Kaede-chan! Your legs!

00:38.630 --> 00:40.590
Aren't you cold?!

00:40.590 --> 00:42.670
You betcha I am!

00:42.670 --> 00:44.580
But beauty is pain, as they say.

00:44.580 --> 00:47.070
Gotta show off these rockin' 
legs while I still got 'em!

00:47.070 --> 00:48.570
I never realized.

00:48.570 --> 00:51.760
Girls are true heroes. 
Thank you for your service.

00:51.760 --> 00:53.340
I don't know how she does it.

00:53.340 --> 00:55.750
It's so cold, I had to leave my hair down.

00:56.410 --> 00:57.400
Wait!

00:57.620 --> 01:00.960
You're wearing the scarf, Mahiro-chan!

01:00.960 --> 01:03.580
Mihari and I picked it out together!

01:03.580 --> 01:05.260
Oh, that's right.

01:05.260 --> 01:06.860
Now we're matching, huh?

01:08.670 --> 01:11.050
This feels kinda weird!

01:11.050 --> 01:13.860
Who cares? You two are besties, aren't you?

01:14.240 --> 01:17.720
C'mon, Onee-chan! Knock it off!

01:15.990 --> 01:17.570
<i>Still, when we show up like this...</i>

01:17.570 --> 01:19.960
<i>Miyo-chan's gonna go nuts!</i>

01:17.720 --> 01:19.960
At least let me take a picture!

01:32.610 --> 01:33.690
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

01:34.190 --> 01:35.320
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

01:37.490 --> 01:40.620
<b>Mahiro Oyama</b>

01:43.790 --> 01:46.830
<b>Mihari Oyama</b>

02:41.640 --> 02:50.020
<b>ONIMAI: I'm Now Your Sister</b>

02:54.020 --> 02:58.900
<b>#10 Mahiro Ponders Boobs and Identity</b>

02:54.480 --> 02:56.040
Oh, my!

02:56.040 --> 02:57.420
Why, what's this?

02:57.420 --> 02:59.110
My gosh, what a pleasant surprise!

02:59.610 --> 03:02.180
Yup, I called it.

03:02.180 --> 03:03.520
Aw, neat!

03:03.520 --> 03:06.030
Maybe I should get a matching one, too!

03:06.590 --> 03:07.850
Asahi-chan.

03:07.850 --> 03:10.240
It's only neat because 
<i>they're</i> the ones matching.

03:10.240 --> 03:12.040
Are we <i>clear</i>?

03:12.970 --> 03:16.740
Besides, you never wear scarves anyway.

03:17.120 --> 03:18.310
You've got a point.

03:19.560 --> 03:22.540
And you're always wearing shorts when
 you're not in your school uniform.

03:22.940 --> 03:25.930
Yeah, I never get cold.

03:26.820 --> 03:29.910
And as usual, I'm not wearing
 anything under my skirt.

03:31.320 --> 03:32.630
That phrasing...

03:32.630 --> 03:34.440
You're so devil-may-care.

03:34.440 --> 03:37.560
I had to put warm fleece 
leggings on under mine.

03:37.560 --> 03:38.830
See?

03:42.470 --> 03:44.200
Quit staring, boys!

03:44.200 --> 03:45.560
You jerks!

03:45.940 --> 03:47.960
W-Wait, but!

03:45.940 --> 03:47.960
W-We weren't!

03:47.960 --> 03:49.370
I wasn't even looking!

03:49.370 --> 03:50.120
Hey, wait!

03:50.120 --> 03:51.800
Get back here!

03:51.800 --> 03:53.020
Quit running away!

03:53.020 --> 03:53.850
Come back!

03:53.850 --> 03:56.790
I swear, you can be so careless sometimes.

03:57.520 --> 03:58.760
Mahiro-chan?

03:59.140 --> 04:02.800
I-I didn't know my voice 
could go that high...

04:02.800 --> 04:06.730
<i>I-Is this what it feels like 
when girls get self-conscious?!</i>

04:06.730 --> 04:08.860
<i>Not good! This is not good!</i>

04:08.860 --> 04:10.960
<i>I've gone too deep undercover!</i>

04:10.960 --> 04:13.760
<i>I gotta reclaim my masculinity!</i>

04:13.760 --> 04:15.240
Bare-naked legs!

04:15.240 --> 04:17.010
Wh-What's the matter?

04:17.010 --> 04:18.370
You good?

04:19.710 --> 04:22.160
Ah, the bare-naked leg.

04:22.160 --> 04:23.790
What a sight to behold!

04:23.790 --> 04:27.150
Especially the legs of the girls 
braving the cold winter air.

04:27.750 --> 04:29.970
But that's bad for you!

04:29.970 --> 04:30.700
Huh?

04:30.700 --> 04:33.800
You'll catch a cold if you 
don't cover up properly.

04:33.800 --> 04:36.990
Uh, yeah. That's true... I guess.

04:36.990 --> 04:40.300
Besides, I heard it makes 
your legs get chubby.

04:40.300 --> 04:43.870
Your body stores more fat when exposed 
to low temperatures, after all.

04:43.870 --> 04:45.550
Huh.

04:45.550 --> 04:47.930
So you gain fat when you expose yourself?

04:47.930 --> 04:50.000
So that means Miyo-chin...

04:50.000 --> 04:52.950
must be whipping her boobies out every day!

04:53.880 --> 04:55.720
I've never whipped them out!

05:00.000 --> 05:02.740
I-I don't do that, okay?

05:02.740 --> 05:05.280
I don't, okay?!

05:05.280 --> 05:07.690
Calm down, Miyo-chan!

05:08.140 --> 05:10.200
There, there. You poor thing.

05:10.200 --> 05:12.490
I'm sorry, Miyo-chin.

05:12.490 --> 05:14.670
There, there. You're okay.

05:13.030 --> 05:15.680
Boobies, huh?

05:19.080 --> 05:21.000
<b>ONIMAI</b>

05:19.250 --> 05:20.470
<i>Onimai.</i>

05:25.000 --> 05:25.960
Oh!

05:25.960 --> 05:27.430
Rise and shine!

05:30.370 --> 05:32.700
Wait! Keep still, okay?

05:32.700 --> 05:34.560
I'm almost finished.

05:34.560 --> 05:36.010
There, all set!

05:36.890 --> 05:37.650
Huh?

05:37.650 --> 05:39.920
Aww! It's so cute!

05:39.920 --> 05:42.680
Long hair is so much more fun to play with!

05:42.680 --> 05:45.850
If only Momiji would grow hers out, too.

05:46.740 --> 05:48.960
Th-That aside, Kaede-chan.

05:48.960 --> 05:50.570
How come you're here?

05:51.020 --> 05:52.280
Oh, crap...

05:52.640 --> 05:54.200
Kaede!

05:54.200 --> 05:56.990
That's the exact same page 
I left you on earlier.

05:56.990 --> 05:58.590
Sorry, teach!

05:58.590 --> 06:00.300
I took a break and got sidetracked.

06:00.300 --> 06:02.960
Oh, Mihari's tutoring again.

06:01.420 --> 06:02.960
What question was I on again?

06:20.270 --> 06:23.380
You're such a good student, Kaede-chan!

06:23.380 --> 06:25.470
What? Not by a long shot!

06:25.470 --> 06:26.810
Lately, I've been working a lot.

06:26.810 --> 06:29.660
What do you need the 
money for? A motorcycle?

06:29.930 --> 06:32.900
Don't be silly! That's 
something a boy would want!

06:32.900 --> 06:35.440
A girl's gotta stock up on 
the essentials, you know?

06:35.440 --> 06:37.330
And clothes can get pretty expensive.

06:37.330 --> 06:38.900
Oh, really...

06:38.900 --> 06:40.090
Don't gimme that.

06:41.010 --> 06:45.000
I also kinda wanna get 
a facial someday, too.

06:45.000 --> 06:46.120
Really?

06:46.120 --> 06:48.290
But you're far too young 
to be thinking about that.

06:48.290 --> 06:50.540
And that's where you're wrong, like always!

06:50.150 --> 06:51.700
Mhmm, mhmm.

06:50.540 --> 06:52.930
You have to start taking measures 
while you're still young.

06:52.930 --> 06:55.430
If you want healthy skin, you 
have to take good care of it!

06:56.060 --> 06:59.330
Like by giving yourself a lymphatic 
massage, for instance.

07:01.150 --> 07:02.420
Oh, I know!

07:02.420 --> 07:05.100
How about I give you a little 
hands-on experience?

07:05.100 --> 07:07.450
It'll be my gift to you 
for helping me study.

07:13.010 --> 07:15.630
First things first, the collarbone.

07:17.360 --> 07:19.800
This feels a little awkward...

07:20.200 --> 07:22.850
I know. Just relax, okay?

07:24.360 --> 07:26.170
Oh, my...

07:26.170 --> 07:29.160
Miyo-chan would kill to be a 
fly on the wall right now.

07:27.250 --> 07:30.120
Now, we work from the chest 
down below the arms.

07:31.400 --> 07:33.880
C'mon, that tickles!

07:33.880 --> 07:34.650
Whoa!

07:35.480 --> 07:38.550
Then from the lower back down to the sides.

07:39.900 --> 07:41.820
That actually feels really nice.

07:42.260 --> 07:43.730
And for the lower body...

07:44.130 --> 07:46.680
you mustn't forget to work the inner thighs.

07:46.680 --> 07:47.650
What?!

07:47.650 --> 07:49.080
You can't be serious!

07:49.610 --> 07:51.370
Like here, for example.

08:01.670 --> 08:04.040
Phew, now you're all set!

08:04.040 --> 08:06.950
You have a knack for this, Kaede.

08:06.950 --> 08:08.360
You think so?

08:08.360 --> 08:10.600
It doesn't feel that great 
when I do it on myself.

08:10.600 --> 08:12.910
Maybe it feels better when 
someone does it for you.

08:12.910 --> 08:14.020
Shh...

08:16.240 --> 08:18.940
Now then, you're up next, Mahiro-chan.

08:19.800 --> 08:22.700
No way! Forget it! It's way too dirty!

08:22.700 --> 08:25.070
Now, now. Don't be shy.

08:25.070 --> 08:28.540
I'll even throw in a special 
service for a fuller bust!

08:28.540 --> 08:30.780
A-A fuller what?

08:32.440 --> 08:33.740
Wh-Whoa!

08:33.740 --> 08:35.910
Stop, I'm serious!

08:35.910 --> 08:39.710
I said stop!

08:46.370 --> 08:50.520
You know what? My body does 
feel less tense after that.

08:50.520 --> 08:51.950
Right?

08:51.950 --> 08:53.980
You could do this for a living, Kaede.

08:53.980 --> 08:55.410
Like an aesthetician or something.

08:55.410 --> 08:57.320
You think so?

08:57.320 --> 08:59.100
I <i>have</i> considered it before.

08:59.500 --> 09:02.960
Maybe I'll do some more practice 
on Momiji when I get back home.

09:02.960 --> 09:04.310
<i>Onee-chan!</i>

09:04.310 --> 09:06.020
Please tell me you won't!

09:08.150 --> 09:10.020
<b>ONIMAI</b>

09:08.300 --> 09:09.590
<i>Onimai.</i>

09:11.330 --> 09:12.750
Onii-chan!

09:15.550 --> 09:16.370
Huh?

09:18.450 --> 09:19.780
Here, take these.

09:23.100 --> 09:24.200
Chocolate?

09:24.870 --> 09:27.120
Yeah, it's Valentine's Day!

09:27.120 --> 09:28.660
Oh!

09:28.660 --> 09:31.750
It doesn't count when you 
get it from family, though.

09:31.750 --> 09:33.240
Besides, isn't this a little much?

09:33.980 --> 09:36.680
H-Hey, wait a sec! Don't eat it!

09:36.680 --> 09:39.470
You're supposed to be giving 
them out this year, remember?

09:40.120 --> 09:41.040
What?

09:50.640 --> 09:55.150
I can't believe I have to hand out 
all this chocolate to stupid boys.

09:55.540 --> 09:58.570
Oh! Good morning, Mahiro-chan!

09:58.570 --> 10:00.540
Good morning, Momiji.

10:01.340 --> 10:02.990
Here, this is for you!

10:05.660 --> 10:08.110
Oh, wow! Thanks so much!

10:10.620 --> 10:11.490
Huh?

10:11.900 --> 10:12.910
Oh, right!

10:14.750 --> 10:16.370
Here, this is yours!

10:17.000 --> 10:19.920
Yay, you're the best!

10:20.220 --> 10:22.710
I forgot friends give them 
to each other too!

10:22.710 --> 10:25.810
Mihari really thought of everything.

10:25.810 --> 10:28.500
While we're at it, here's some from me too.

10:29.000 --> 10:30.050
Enjoy!

10:32.880 --> 10:35.430
Valentine's Day rules!

10:35.430 --> 10:37.750
They're both homemade, by the way!

10:38.460 --> 10:40.840
Momiji and I made them together!

10:40.840 --> 10:44.110
She's never asked to make them together. 
It made me so happy.

10:44.110 --> 10:46.980
C'mon! You weren't supposed to tell her!

10:48.700 --> 10:50.250
<i>Homemade chocolates...</i>

10:58.350 --> 11:01.570
Here, Mahiron! I brought you chocolate!

11:01.570 --> 11:03.470
I brought you some too!

11:04.010 --> 11:07.160
Why, thank you. Much obliged.

11:09.260 --> 11:11.580
Now, a token of my gratitude.

11:11.580 --> 11:13.280
Thanks!

11:13.280 --> 11:14.800
Thank you!

11:15.310 --> 11:19.230
Man, this trading system 
means everyone's happy, huh?

11:19.650 --> 11:22.550
Plus, you get to try all sorts 
of chocolate this way, too!

11:22.550 --> 11:23.390
Right?

11:23.390 --> 11:24.760
Exactly!

11:24.760 --> 11:26.420
You two are such gluttons.

11:30.140 --> 11:31.470
C'mon, let's trade!

11:31.470 --> 11:32.520
So yummy!

11:32.520 --> 11:33.260
Right?

11:34.800 --> 11:37.130
<i>I suppose I do have some 
chocolate left over.</i>

11:37.130 --> 11:38.420
<i>All right!</i>

11:38.420 --> 11:39.450
Here you go!

11:39.450 --> 11:40.880
Here, take this!

11:40.880 --> 11:42.010
You too!

11:42.010 --> 11:43.620
And you, and you as well!

11:48.470 --> 11:50.320
<i>I'm up to my ears!</i>

11:50.320 --> 11:52.190
<i>Look at me! I'm living the dream!</i>

11:52.750 --> 11:55.820
This would never happen 
if I were still a boy.

12:00.700 --> 12:03.710
Yikes... It's hell on earth.

12:03.710 --> 12:06.170
Valentine's Day, am I right?

12:04.550 --> 12:06.970
What sad little creatures.

12:06.170 --> 12:07.250
Just a marketing ploy...

12:07.250 --> 12:08.970
I'm not a huge sweet tooth, anyway.

12:07.530 --> 12:09.860
But I know exactly how they feel.

12:10.260 --> 12:12.130
I guess it can't hurt.

12:13.890 --> 12:15.750
How's it goin', gents?

12:15.750 --> 12:16.590
Huh?

12:17.700 --> 12:20.650
Here! You can have this!

12:22.760 --> 12:24.260
From one classmate to another.

12:24.540 --> 12:26.360
Totally platonic.

12:26.360 --> 12:29.380
F-Fine, I guess I can take it.

12:29.380 --> 12:32.400
N-Not that we're happy about it or anything.

12:32.400 --> 12:34.340
These two are actually pretty cute.

12:35.030 --> 12:37.310
No need to return the favor, okay?

12:43.170 --> 12:44.230
Wha—?!

12:44.230 --> 12:46.210
I-I want some too!

12:46.210 --> 12:47.830
Me too!

12:48.340 --> 12:50.530
What are you guys, zombies?!

12:50.530 --> 12:52.800
I actually <i>am</i> a sweet tooth...

12:52.800 --> 12:55.050
I'm all out! That was the <i>last</i> one!

12:56.130 --> 12:57.360
Hand it over!

12:57.360 --> 12:59.540
Give it to me!

13:00.070 --> 13:02.870
H-Hey, stay back!

13:09.790 --> 13:13.500
Just ignore them, Oyama-san. 
Boys are idiots.

13:13.500 --> 13:14.760
Those jerks.

13:23.030 --> 13:25.950
I guess this is the one day I'm 
actually glad to be a girl.

13:30.350 --> 13:32.610
I really need to thank Mihari somehow.

13:32.610 --> 13:35.680
<i>It's February 14th. In other 
words, Valentine's Day!</i>

13:35.680 --> 13:39.090
<i>It's time to give chocolate to that 
special someone in your life!</i>

13:39.090 --> 13:43.340
<i>In stores today, we have all 
sorts of confections on offer!</i>

13:41.130 --> 13:45.550
<b>Valentine's Day Fair</b>

13:41.130 --> 13:45.550
Thank You

13:41.130 --> 13:45.550
<b>Chocolate</b>

13:41.130 --> 13:45.550
Thank You

13:41.130 --> 13:45.550
<b>Candy</b>

13:43.340 --> 13:45.560
<i>Choose from our special thank-you 
line to express your gratitude!</i>

13:47.600 --> 13:48.970
I'm home!

13:51.250 --> 13:53.000
Welcome home, Onii-chan!

13:53.540 --> 13:54.790
How'd it go?

13:55.890 --> 13:58.100
Check it! I'm set for life!

13:58.100 --> 14:00.800
Wow, aren't you lucky?

14:02.500 --> 14:04.220
Here's some from me, too.

14:06.570 --> 14:07.880
Here!

14:07.880 --> 14:10.080
Since the stuff I gave you 
this morning was for school.

14:10.370 --> 14:13.050
Hey, one more for the pile!

14:13.050 --> 14:15.760
Then I'll give you yours now, too.

14:17.780 --> 14:18.540
Here!

14:26.820 --> 14:31.090
Warn me next time, you dummy!

14:32.120 --> 14:34.200
You're such a crybaby!

