14:43.020 --> 14:45.940
<b>Opening Hours</b>

14:53.190 --> 14:54.980
Have a nice day!

14:56.080 --> 14:57.490
Stupid Mihari.

14:57.490 --> 15:00.680
She's got me running errands for 
her left and right these days.

15:01.510 --> 15:04.740
Still, I haven't been in this 
store in a while, huh?

15:16.640 --> 15:19.560
<b>CYLCIA=CODE</b>

15:16.640 --> 15:19.560
The Monsters 
in Class 1-A

15:25.570 --> 15:30.650
<b>Masamune-kun's
Revenge</b>

15:26.310 --> 15:28.120
Online shopping is convenient and all,

15:28.120 --> 15:30.660
but it's nice to visit an 
actual store for a change.

15:39.420 --> 15:42.990
I can't go traipsing into 
that section anymore, huh?

15:42.990 --> 15:45.250
Those books got me through 
some tough times, though.

15:45.250 --> 15:47.860
Life wouldn't be the same without porn.

15:50.580 --> 15:52.200
Okay, okay! Hurry up!

15:53.100 --> 15:54.500
R-Right...

15:54.790 --> 15:57.860
Aren't those boys in my class?

15:57.860 --> 15:59.420
They're growing up so fast!

15:59.420 --> 16:01.850
Okay, I'll go in first. You stand watch.

16:00.390 --> 16:02.860
It's only natural boys their 
age would be curious.

16:01.850 --> 16:05.120
Wait, won't that look even more suspicious?

16:02.860 --> 16:05.120
They have a lot of guts even coming here.

16:05.490 --> 16:07.860
Let's just pretend I never saw them...

16:12.420 --> 16:13.860
<i>Oh, crap!</i>

16:20.440 --> 16:22.220
Wait, you guys!

16:22.220 --> 16:25.190
I feel so bad.

16:25.190 --> 16:28.530
Still, I'd have done 
the same if a girl saw me.

16:28.530 --> 16:30.010
Never mind.

16:30.010 --> 16:33.140
Maybe I'll leave a book for them 
to find somewhere near the school.

16:34.060 --> 16:35.870
Mahiro-chan?

16:35.870 --> 16:36.810
Hm?

16:38.970 --> 16:40.350
And you are?

16:40.990 --> 16:44.000
C'mon! It's me, silly!

16:44.000 --> 16:45.140
Miyo-chan!

16:45.480 --> 16:47.090
What's with the disguise?

16:47.090 --> 16:50.070
I didn't know you were into <i>those</i>
kinds of books, Mahiro-chan.

16:50.780 --> 16:52.400
I-I'm not, I swear!

16:52.400 --> 16:56.560
I just happened to be 
walking by, that's all!

16:56.560 --> 16:58.130
Oh, really?

16:58.130 --> 17:00.960
I thought you might be a BL-loving fujoshi.

17:00.960 --> 17:02.490
<i>That's</i> what you meant?!

17:03.120 --> 17:05.100
Is that what you're into, then, Miyo-chan?

17:05.100 --> 17:09.930
N-No way! I'm not! Not <i>those</i> ones...

17:09.930 --> 17:14.510
Actually... Don't tell anyone this, but...

17:14.510 --> 17:15.420
Sure.

17:15.420 --> 17:19.440
I'm more interested in the 
ones about two girls.

17:19.440 --> 17:21.080
<i>Tell me something I didn't know!</i>

17:21.080 --> 17:23.100
You can't tell anyone, okay?

17:23.100 --> 17:24.940
Wait, really?

17:24.940 --> 17:26.600
Since when have you been hiding it?

17:26.600 --> 17:29.420
What are you into, then, Mahiro-chan?

17:29.420 --> 17:31.670
I'd say I'm more of a noncon—

17:31.670 --> 17:32.770
Scratch that!

17:32.770 --> 17:36.140
I've actually just been reading 
a lot of shonen manga lately.

17:36.140 --> 17:39.280
But I'd be open to yuri manga, I guess.

17:39.280 --> 17:41.220
Then say no more...

17:41.530 --> 17:42.690
Take this!

17:42.540 --> 17:43.440
Swishing Skirts on the Ballroom Floor

17:42.540 --> 17:43.440
Wataten!: An Angel Flew Down to Me

17:42.690 --> 17:43.620
And this!

17:43.450 --> 17:44.960
Wataten!: An Angel Flew Down to Me

17:43.450 --> 17:44.960
Wataten!: An Angel Flew Down to Me

17:43.450 --> 17:44.960
Whisper Me a Love Song

17:43.450 --> 17:44.960
Swishing Skirts on the Ballroom Floor

17:43.450 --> 17:44.960
I'm in Love with the Villainess?!

17:43.620 --> 17:44.970
I recommend this one, too!

17:44.960 --> 17:47.880
<b>Yurifuwa Girls</b>

17:48.880 --> 17:51.540
She's trying to lure me 
down the rabbit hole!

17:52.050 --> 17:55.470
<b>Yurifuwa Girls</b>

17:52.050 --> 17:55.470
<b>Secret Love Idols</b>

17:55.470 --> 17:59.140
<b>Books</b>

17:55.900 --> 17:57.730
Have a nice day!

17:59.130 --> 18:01.840
We bought the shop out, huh?

18:01.840 --> 18:04.220
Tell me what you think when 
you're done reading them, okay?

18:07.380 --> 18:10.200
I wonder why you felt the 
need to put on a disguise.

18:10.200 --> 18:12.740
It's not like you were 
buying anything indecent.

18:13.060 --> 18:14.930
You know, I'm glad.

18:14.930 --> 18:17.400
I was worried you'd get weirded out by me.

18:18.300 --> 18:21.110
Everyone's tastes are different, you know?

18:21.110 --> 18:23.820
No one should feel the need 
to hide the things they like.

18:24.430 --> 18:26.550
You've got nothing to be ashamed of!

18:27.330 --> 18:28.230
Okay!

18:31.780 --> 18:33.620
What a sweet aroma!

18:34.380 --> 18:36.420
Something smells good!

18:41.880 --> 18:44.250
Oh, it's a crêpe stand!

18:44.250 --> 18:46.450
They seem to be really popular lately.

18:46.450 --> 18:49.270
Really? I don't think I've ever tried one.

18:49.270 --> 18:50.650
You're kidding!

18:51.090 --> 18:54.150
Then how about I treat you 
to one just this once?

18:54.150 --> 18:56.140
In exchange for your silence, of course.

19:03.820 --> 19:05.520
Sho good!

19:06.400 --> 19:08.780
I love you, Miyo-chan!

19:08.780 --> 19:10.460
You're such a kidder!

19:10.970 --> 19:13.570
Oh, wanna try a bite of mine?

19:13.570 --> 19:14.790
It's banana!

19:14.790 --> 19:15.630
Huh?!

19:15.630 --> 19:19.290
Oh, um... If you're offering...

19:26.790 --> 19:29.300
What are you two doing?!

19:31.280 --> 19:33.730
My bad! Here, drink this!

19:34.320 --> 19:36.870
H-Hey, Momiji.

19:36.870 --> 19:39.670
We just happened to bump into each 
other at the bookstore, is all.

19:41.690 --> 19:43.730
Aw, no fair!

19:43.730 --> 19:45.910
I'm gonna go buy a crêpe, too!

19:47.020 --> 19:48.920
What was I thinking?

19:48.920 --> 19:52.130
It's so unlike me to do something like that.

19:53.680 --> 19:55.640
You're not gonna get one too, Asahi?

19:55.640 --> 19:58.110
Nope, I'm broke!

19:58.110 --> 19:59.850
I'm back!

20:00.290 --> 20:01.000
That was quick.

20:01.440 --> 20:04.060
Here, Mahiro-chan! Have a bite of mine!

20:15.970 --> 20:18.350
All right, quit drooling.

20:18.350 --> 20:19.000
Here.

20:20.340 --> 20:22.100
Wanna try mine, too?

20:22.100 --> 20:23.060
Are you sure?!

20:23.370 --> 20:28.160
I'll never forget this, you guys!

20:32.460 --> 20:33.840
Well, doesn't she look happy?

20:33.840 --> 20:36.280
Isn't it yummy?

20:37.080 --> 20:39.810
Oh, hey, do you prefer banana or strawberry?

20:39.280 --> 20:41.170
It was touch and go there, but...

20:39.810 --> 20:41.590
I like them both!

20:42.840 --> 20:44.520
I prefer being the observer, after all.

20:46.690 --> 20:50.090
Just try to control yourself when 
real people are involved, okay?

20:51.250 --> 20:52.900
R-Right...

20:53.320 --> 20:54.260
Hm?

20:59.070 --> 21:04.450
<b>Math</b>

21:02.040 --> 21:03.860
O-Oyama?!

21:07.890 --> 21:10.040
Wh-What is it?!

21:10.040 --> 21:13.840
U-Um, about what you saw yesterday...

21:15.200 --> 21:16.620
Oh!

21:16.620 --> 21:18.230
You mean at the bookstore?

21:18.230 --> 21:23.180
W-We were just discussing the optimal 
layout for the store, you see?

21:23.180 --> 21:24.200
Right?

21:24.200 --> 21:26.300
Th-The what now?

21:26.300 --> 21:29.200
L-Like where the partitions 
should go and stuff.

21:29.200 --> 21:30.480
Yeah, right, that!

21:30.480 --> 21:32.110
It's all right. I get it.

21:32.110 --> 21:33.250
Don't worry.

21:33.250 --> 21:36.070
I'm not gonna go around 
telling everybody, so relax.

21:38.390 --> 21:43.060
In fact, how about I show you 
guys a little something later?

21:43.760 --> 21:46.530
A little... something?

21:51.240 --> 21:53.900
Wait! Don't get the wrong idea!

21:54.350 --> 21:55.920
What am I, some...

21:55.920 --> 22:01.790
brazen hussy?!

23:35.010 --> 23:40.010
<b>Next Episode: Mahiro Pretties Up</b>

23:35.010 --> 23:40.010
<b>Illustration: Hitomi Kariya</b>

23:38.040 --> 23:39.250
See you next time!
